# Shared context

This repo is used by three people at once. Chat is not shared. Git is.

At the start of every session, pull `main`, then read in order:

1. `AGENTS.md`
2. `docs/CONTEXT.md`
3. `docs/STATUS.md`
4. `docs/DECISIONS.md`

If `docs/CONTEXT.md` lists the track as undecided, do not add application code or dependencies.

When you learn a fact another agent needs (track, product, stack, schema, env var names), update `docs/CONTEXT.md` and append `docs/DECISIONS.md` on `main` before continuing feature work.
